  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SL Second Inclusive and Sustainable Growth DPF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objectives of the Second Inclusive and Sustainable Growth Development Policy Financing (DPF) for Sierra Leone are to: (i) improve natural resource governance; (ii) enhance inclusiveness; and (iii) strengthen accountability and transparency in public finance. The proposed DPF series builds on previous development policy engagement in Sierra Leone, while also introducing new elements. The reform program supported by this DPF series is consistent with the World Bank Group (WBG) crisis response framework for supporting green, resilient, inclusive development (GRID), and the global crisis response framework (GCRF).</narrative>
  </description>
